  "name": "Pix2Struct: Screenshot Parsing as Pretraining for Visual Language Understanding",
  "notes": "Reviewed against the complete official arXiv abstract. Experimental results and linked artifact availability have not been independently reproduced. Adjacent visual-language pretraining: webpage screenshot parsing and explicit UI evaluation support interface understanding; the paper does not establish an autonomous GUI policy.",
  "published_at": "2022-10-07",
  "relations": [],
  "review_status": "curated",
  "scope": "adjacent",
  "summary": "Pix2Struct pretrains an image-to-text model by reconstructing simplified HTML from masked webpage screenshots. Its variable-resolution visual representation is evaluated across several domains, including user-interface understanding.",
